"text":"a","key":"a","startChar":1211,"endChar":1212,"startMs":79400,"endMs":79480,"confidence":0.9821,"matched":true},{"text":"reliable","key":"reliable","startChar":1213,"endChar":1221,"startMs":79480,"endMs":79860,"confidence":0.9991,"matched":true},{"text":"path","key":"path","startChar":1222,"endChar":1226,"startMs":79860,"endMs":80300,"confidence":0.9982,"matched":true},{"text":"to","key":"to","startChar":1227,"endChar":1229,"startMs":80300,"endMs":80480,"confidence":0.9992,"matched":true},{"text":"retrieve","key":"retrieve","startChar":1230,"endChar":1238,"startMs":80480,"endMs":80780,"confidence":0.3114,"matched":true},{"text":"more","key":"more","startChar":1239,"endChar":1243,"startMs":80780,"endMs":81160,"confidence":0.9987,"matched":true},{"text":"when","key":"when","startChar":1244,"endChar":1248,"startMs":81160,"endMs":81340,"confidence":0.9881,"matched":true},{"text":"needed","key":"needed","startChar":1249,"endChar":1255,"startMs":81340,"endMs":81600,"confidence":0.996,"matched":true}],"phrases":[{"text":"A dependency upgrade is our first case.","startMs":0,"endMs":3660},{"text":"In Ravi's fictional coding loop, tool definitions and large","startMs":3660,"endMs":6960},{"text":"file reads fill much of the context before the","startMs":6960,"endMs":9560},{"text":"first change.","startMs":9560,"endMs":11060},{"text":"Later iterations retain old file contents and superseded plans.","startMs":11060,"endMs":16080},{"text":"The model begins repeating work and referring to defects","startMs":16080,"endMs":19040},{"text":"already repaired.","startMs":19040,"endMs":21200},{"text":"A compatibility exception is our second case.","startMs":21200,"endMs":24160},{"text":"A focused retriever supplies the new API documentation but","startMs":24160,"endMs":27920},{"text":"omits a compatibility requirement for older clients, so a","startMs":27920,"endMs":31780},{"text":"seemingly correct update breaks them.","startMs":31780,"endMs":34740},{"text":"A large log search is our third case.","startMs":34740,"endMs":37660},{"text":"Returning every line can bury the relevant event, while","startMs":37660,"endMs":40580},{"text":"returning only a conclusion can hide the search limit","startMs":40580,"endMs":43420},{"text":"that made it incomplete.","startMs":43420,"endMs":45460},{"text":"These cases show both sides of context design: too","startMs":45460,"endMs":49180},{"text":"much content and missing evidence can each undermine a","startMs":49180,"endMs":52400},{"text":"decision.","startMs":52400,"endMs":53820},{"text":"These scenarios illustrate the design problem.","startMs":53820,"endMs":55840},{"text":"They are not verified measurements of cost or model","startMs":55840,"endMs":59100},{"text":"performance.","startMs":59100,"endMs":60700},{"text":"Our governing question is: how do we reduce noise","startMs":60700,"endMs":63620},{"text":"without hiding a necessary fact?","startMs":63620,"endMs":66260},{"text":"By the end, you should be able to allocate","startMs":66260,"endMs":68160},{"text":"a context budget, preserve freshness and coverage, choose a","startMs":68160,"endMs":71960},{"text":"retrieval strategy, and evaluate the resulting decisions.","startMs":71960,"endMs":75980},{"text":"We are aiming for sufficient evidence for the current","startMs":75980,"endMs":78280},{"text":"task, with a reliable path to retrieve more when","startMs":78280,"endMs":81340},{"text":"needed.","startMs":81340,"endMs":81600}],"boardEvents":[{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":0},{"atMs":0,"actionIndex":1},{"atMs":21200,"actionIndex":2},{"atMs":34740,"actionIndex":3},{"atMs":60700,"actionIndex":4},{"atMs":76940,"actionIndex":5}],"boardTimingMethod":"authored-spoken-cues-v1"}